The '''2022 Worthing Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Worthing Borough Council]], on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|UK local elections]].

The [[Labour Party (UK)|Labour Party]] won control of the council for the first time,<ref>{{Cite news |date=2022-05-06 |title=Sussex election results 2022: Labour wins control of Worthing for first time |language=en-GB |work=BBC News |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/uk-england-sussex-61334904 |access-date=2022-05-06}}</ref> ending 18 years of [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative]] administration.

